3120
02:45:26,886 --> 02:45:29,685
'All beings are equal in birth
But work decides their varied worth'

3121
02:45:30,685 --> 02:45:31,765
We are well aware

3122
02:45:32,685 --> 02:45:34,285
[laughter of 'victory']

3123
02:45:35,646 --> 02:45:36,886
NO

3124
02:45:38,285 --> 02:45:39,566
[panic attack]

3125
02:45:41,486 --> 02:45:42,646
You lost

3126
02:46:11,765 --> 02:46:13,126
Not only democracy

3127
02:46:13,765 --> 02:46:16,646
No one on earth can destroy
our beloved democratic leader, da

3128
02:46:20,566 --> 02:46:22,126
[appreciative whistle]

3129
02:46:22,326 --> 02:46:24,605
He is hitting you and
you are happily taking it

3130
02:46:26,845 --> 02:46:28,445
Fear flew far away!

3131
02:47:30,085 --> 02:47:31,046
Kill them

3132
02:47:32,525 --> 02:47:35,765
Son of King Ravana
Stand-alone Yama in the arena

3133
02:47:36,085 --> 02:47:39,565
Every reflection is his own
Leader of the universe; well-known

3134
02:47:39,566 --> 02:47:43,045
Come and touch me if you dare
Blood will spurt for all I care

3135
02:47:43,046 --> 02:47:44,684
Who is the bull(y) that dares to fight?

3136
02:47:44,685 --> 02:47:46,485
Our leader is the symbol of light

3137
02:47:46,486 --> 02:47:49,205
A deadly tilt in his stride

3138
02:47:49,925 --> 02:47:53,364
Power coiling in every nerve inside

3139
02:47:53,365 --> 02:47:56,126
Your blessed fate to be hit

3140
02:47:56,726 --> 02:48:00,085
Into a spin swift
your brain will split

3141
02:48:00,205 --> 02:48:03,524
Do you have the warrior-spirit?
Or hollow pride of unscaled summit?

3142
02:48:03,525 --> 02:48:06,965
Madness to provoke him, you moron
Is your face not yet swollen?

3143
02:48:06,966 --> 02:48:10,245
A hero of flame; victory-star
Whoever defies, limbs will char

3144
02:48:10,246 --> 02:48:13,965
Once his true colors come to light
You'll freeze; blessed or cursed plight

3145
02:48:13,966 --> 02:48:16,886
You could script his life as dialogue

3146
02:48:17,326 --> 02:48:20,844
He serves his foes an epilogue
His tale transcends every monologue

3147
02:48:20,845 --> 02:48:25,806
Send an enemy, he will simply smile
As if he is used to it; that's his style

3148
02:48:28,445 --> 02:48:32,045
Son of Ravana, born to command
Like Yama, he needs no second hand

3149
02:48:32,046 --> 02:48:35,326
He is the soul in every frame
The universe bows to his name

3150
02:48:39,765 --> 02:48:42,445
- Himmler
- Land the chopper on the terrace

3151
02:48:42,646 --> 02:48:44,365
- Down... down
- Come on

3152
02:48:44,566 --> 02:48:45,565
He has ruined everything

3153
02:48:45,566 --> 02:48:46,565
I HAVE LOST!

3154
02:48:46,566 --> 02:48:47,764
You've come so far

3155
02:48:47,765 --> 02:48:48,965
We can fight another day

3156
02:48:48,966 --> 02:48:49,966
Hurry up

3157
02:48:57,845 --> 02:48:58,925
Blast!

3158
02:49:58,726 --> 02:50:02,126
Do you know why India is hailed
as the biggest democratic country, da?

3159
02:50:03,365 --> 02:50:07,005
No other country can boast of
varied castes, religions or languages

3160
02:50:08,445 --> 02:50:09,485
Despite such differences

3161
02:50:09,486 --> 02:50:12,045
If a nation can co-exist
as 'unity in diversity'

3162
02:50:12,046 --> 02:50:13,365
That is only my motherland India

3163
02:50:14,126 --> 02:50:16,005
Trying to destroy that democracy

3164
02:50:16,845 --> 02:50:18,605
No damn top dog can succeed

3165
02:50:19,646 --> 02:50:21,726
No bloody so-called big shot can do so

3166
02:50:22,166 --> 02:50:24,166
No goddamn kingpin can succeed

3167
02:50:24,445 --> 02:50:25,444
In the name of democracy

3168
02:50:25,445 --> 02:50:26,965
A roll-call of names
Countless decisions

3169
02:50:26,966 --> 02:50:28,085
'Chaos unrestrained'

3170
02:50:29,765 --> 02:50:31,726
We need Dictatorship

3171
02:50:32,246 --> 02:50:33,406
One command

3172
02:50:45,765 --> 02:50:47,445
This incident will prove
to the whole world

3173
02:50:48,085 --> 02:50:50,525
No damn offender can
push India into danger

3174
02:51:17,845 --> 02:51:19,445
'That girl's fear phobia'

3175
02:51:19,765 --> 02:51:22,365
'And people's fear was erased
by this democracy called'

3176
02:51:22,566 --> 02:51:23,765
'Thalapathy'

3177
02:51:28,005 --> 02:51:29,605
He got into the arena
with grit and guts

3178
02:51:29,925 --> 02:51:31,685
And stood his ground
to save democracy

3179
02:51:32,166 --> 02:51:33,444
Will you do the same?

3180
02:51:33,445 --> 02:51:34,845
[mobile ringing]

3181
02:51:36,685 --> 02:51:38,605
Papampatti villagers
are coming to vote, anna

3182
02:52:25,925 --> 02:52:27,085
Sir

3183
02:52:27,525 --> 02:52:29,246
- Aiyaiyo!
- 'Where are you off to?'

3184
02:52:29,806 --> 02:52:30,806
Come here

3185
02:52:31,046 --> 02:52:32,924
How will tomorrow's verdict be, anna?

3186
02:52:32,925 --> 02:52:34,406
Sir, will there be a change?

3187
02:52:36,246 --> 02:52:37,845
If we want change

3188
02:52:39,525 --> 02:52:40,966
First we must be the change!

3189
02:52:41,445 --> 02:52:45,565
This battle I fight for every one of you
My heartbeat, blood, pulse & breath anew

3190
02:52:45,566 --> 02:52:49,445
As your leader I will stride by your side
Always in my heart all of you will reside

3191
02:52:59,285 --> 02:53:01,685
Only one name spells history

3192
02:53:02,205 --> 02:53:06,085
subtitled by rekhs
calibrated by pradeep

